#!/usr/bin/env bun
/**
 * Bundles mutable source files into a Node.js module for NodePod boot.
 *
 * Usage:
 *   bun scripts/generate-nodepod-boot-files.ts
 *
 * For every .ts file we emit both the raw TS (for agent editing) and a
